    FIXED  U amplitude                by U = m_rel rho_dm, with rho_dm observed
    FIXED  m_rel                      by w and s_0 through the clock identity
    FIXED  lambda^3/beta              by the observed a_0, on either footing
    FIXED  k (hence C)                by f_s = 1 at solar-system accelerations
    FREE   w                          -- bounded above by the flat law and below by criticality
    FREE   s_0                        -- bounded below by the solar system; unbounded above
    FREE   lambda or beta separately  -- only their ratio is fixed; the split is free
    FREE   ell                        -- enters only the health condition U > 4 d ell; unconstrained here
    FREE   kappa (the coefficient)    -- FITTED, and provably underivable by this action class
